---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="container page-shell">
    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h1>Built on real-world problem solving.</h1>
      <p>
        I started in hands-on IT support because I wanted to help people solve the frustrating little
        problems that can throw a whole day off course. Over time, that grew into a business built on
        practical service, honest advice, and showing up when people need help.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="two-col">
      <div class="story-box">
        <h2>My background</h2>
        <p>
          I’ve spent my career working hands-on with the systems people depend on every day—repairing
          what’s failing, improving what’s outdated, and helping local businesses get technology to work
          for them instead of against them.
        </p>
        <p>
          That work naturally grew from break/fix support into custom software and hardware design,
          because I’ve always believed the best solutions are the ones that fit a real business, a real
          team, and a real day-to-day routine.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-box">
        <h2>Experience</h2>
        <ul class="timeline">
          <li>Hands-on field support for small businesses, facilities, and local homeowners</li>
          <li>Network troubleshooting, system repair, and office technology installations</li>
          <li>Custom software development for daily business workflows and practical tools</li>
          <li>Hardware planning, setup, and integration for commercial spaces and growing teams</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">Approach</span>
        <h2>Technology should make work easier, not harder.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid features-grid">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Practical solutions</h3>
          <p>I focus on what actually solves the problem, not what looks good on paper or costs more than it needs to.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Clear communication</h3>
          <p>You’ll get straightforward guidance, realistic timelines, and a clear answer from someone who knows the work firsthand.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Long-term value</h3>
          <p>Whether it’s a repair, a custom build, or a hardware install, the goal is dependable performance that lasts.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
